value.description:
Use this tool when the user asks about UX writing rules, editorial patterns, structure, requirements, checklists, anti-patterns, or how to write a specific type of UI text.

This tool searches pattern files. The pattern catalog is expected to grow, so the tool must search by metadata and meaning, not only by exact file names.

Pattern files may include:
- documentType;
- patternId;
